[{"text":"Anti5[exp] anticommutes all \\gamma^5 in exp to the right. Anti5[exp, n] anticommutes all \\gamma^5 n-times to the right. Anti5[exp, -n] anticommutes all \\gamma^5 n-times to the left.","anchor":"anti5"},{"text":"Overview, DiracOrder, DiracSimplify, DiracTrick.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"GA[5, \\[Mu]] Anti5[%] Anti5[%, -1]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^5.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\mu }\\]","anchor":"cb1-5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\mu }.\\bar{\\gamma }^5\\]","anchor":"cb1-5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^5.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\mu }\\]","anchor":"cb1-5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GA[5, \\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], \\[Delta]] Anti5[%, 2] Anti5[%%, Infinity] Anti5[%, -Infinity]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^5.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\alpha }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\beta }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\gamma }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\delta }\\]","anchor":"cb2-7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\alpha }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\beta }.\\bar{\\gamma }^5.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\gamma }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\delta }\\]","anchor":"cb2-7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\alpha }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\beta }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\gamma }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\delta }.\\bar{\\gamma }^5\\]","anchor":"cb2-7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^5.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\alpha }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\beta }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\gamma }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\delta }\\]","anchor":"cb2-7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"In the naive \\(\\gamma^5\\)-scheme D-dimensional \\gamma-matrices anticommute with \\gamma^5.","anchor":"cb2-7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GA5 . GAD[\\[Mu]] Anti5[%]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^5.\\gamma ^{\\mu }\\]","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\gamma ^{\\mu }.\\bar{\\gamma }^5\\]","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Anti5 also works in the t’Hooft-Veltman-Breitenlohner-Maison scheme","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCSetDiracGammaScheme[\"BMHV\"]; Anti5[GA5 . GAD[\\[Mu]]]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[2 \\hat{\\gamma }^{\\mu }.\\bar{\\gamma }^5-\\gamma ^{\\mu }.\\bar{\\gamma }^5\\]","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCSetDiracGammaScheme[\"NDR\"];","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"}]